        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Scuba N3 is the world's first Cognitive AI powered pool cleaner. Trained on real cleaning data from 200+ pools over two years of R&D, its Navium™ Mode learns your pool's exact layout instead of running a fixed pattern.<br/><br/>🤖 AI Patrol Cleaning with VisionPath™ targets debris the moment it's spotted.<br/>🌊 JetAssist™ scrubs the waterline horizontally, the zone most cleaners miss.<br/>🔒 TÜV Certified Data Privacy – all AI processing stays on the device.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>The Pool Cleaner That Learns Your Pool. By Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><p>Built for in-ground pools up to 1,600 sq ft (150m²), the Scuba N3 is Aiper's first Cognitive AI powered cleaner, not a fixed-pattern robot with a camera bolted on.</p><h3>It actually learns your pool</h3><p>Navium™ Mode was trained on real cleaning data from 200+ pools over two years of development. It adapts to your pool's exact layout in real time instead of repeating a preset route.</p><h3>It goes to the mess, not just past it</h3><p>VisionPath™ AI Patrol Cleaning spots debris as it finds it and adjusts course to target it directly, backed by dual brushes and 4,800 GPH suction for real pickup power.</p><h3>The waterline finally gets handled</h3><p>JetAssist™ scrubs the waterline horizontally, the scum line most robots skip entirely.</p><h3>Ownership, handled</h3><ul><li><strong>Featherlight design</strong> – easy to lower in and lift out.</li><li><strong>TÜV Certified Data Privacy Protection</strong> – AI processing happens on the device, not the cloud.</li><li><strong>2-year manufacturer's warranty.</strong></li><li><strong>Curated and supported by Yard Automation Pros,</strong> before and after the sale.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support:",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Covered by Aiper's 2-year manufacturer's warranty. We reply to emails within 1 business day at support@yardautomationpros.com.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>No installation required. Charge on the wireless dock, lower it into the pool thanks to the featherlight design, then start a cycle with one click on the device or in the Aiper App. It returns to the waterline on its own and alerts your phone when done.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Specifications",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<h3>Cleaning &amp; Power</h3><ul><li><strong>Suction:</strong> Up to 4,800 GPH, dual brushes</li><li><strong>Coverage:</strong> Floor, walls, waterline, and stairs</li><li><strong>Pool size:</strong> Up to 1,600 sq ft (150m²), in-ground</li></ul><h3>Cognitive AI &amp; Navigation</h3><ul><li><strong>Navium™ Mode:</strong> Learns pool layout in real time, trained on 200+ real pools</li><li><strong>VisionPath™:</strong> AI Patrol Cleaning, targets debris as it's spotted</li><li><strong>JetAssist™:</strong> Horizontal waterline scrubbing</li></ul><h3>Filtration</h3><ul><li><strong>Dual filtration:</strong> 180μm fine filter basket or 3μm MicroMesh™ ultra-fine filter</li><li><strong>Basket capacity:</strong> 3.5L, top-load</li></ul><h3>Battery &amp; Build</h3><ul><li><strong>Battery:</strong> Up to 180 minutes runtime</li><li><strong>Charge time:</strong> 5 hours, wireless dock</li><li><strong>Weight:</strong> 8.2kg, featherlight design</li></ul><h3>Privacy &amp; Warranty</h3><ul><li><strong>TÜV Certified Data Privacy Protection</strong> – on-device AI processing</li><li><strong>Warranty:</strong> 2-year manufacturer's warranty</li></ul>"
          }
        },
